---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="About — Peggy"
  description="I design learning experiences and build products for the people who run learning — a long line from insurance and international education to TalentLabs and Dao Dao."
>
  <div class="wrap wrap--prose">
    <section class="section--tight" style="padding-top:var(--uwp-space-16)">
      <div style="margin-top:var(--uwp-space-4)">
        <h1 style="font-size:var(--uwp-text-4xl)">Peggy</h1>
        <p style="margin-top:var(--uwp-space-2);color:var(--uwp-color-text-muted)">Learning experience · Products for the people who run learning</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==== BIO ================================================ -->
    <section class="case-section">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>I design learning experiences, and I build with AI for the people who make learning happen. The thread through all of it—helping people start, and helping them finish. I use adult learning principles to design experiences that truly engage people. Whether through live workshops, group programs, or self-paced learning, my focus is always on what drives real change.</p>
        <p>I also build digital products for the educators who guide these journeys. I lead product strategy, UX, and research for a platform that helps mentors and trainers manage their learners, improve results, and build a strong community. By building with AI, I create tools that let them focus on what matters most: keeping learners motivated to show up.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==== TIMELINE ============================= -->
    <section class="case-section">
      <ul class="timeline">
        <li>
          <span class="timeline__when">2022 – now</span>
          <span><strong>TalentLabs</strong> · Learning Product Manager — end-to-end product for the LMS serving 500+ learners across 10+ B2B enterprise clients; first-line owner during live cohort incidents.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="timeline__when">2023 – now</span>
          <span><strong><a class="uwp-link" href="https://daodao.so" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dao Dao</a></strong> · Product Strategy Advisor — early-stage edtech; product direction, B2B2C pivot strategy, PRDs, and competitor research.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="timeline__when">2020 – 2023</span>
          <span><strong>Productside, USA</strong> · Virtual Workshop Facilitator (Freelance) — live product-management workshops for international B2B clients.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="timeline__when">2019 – 2020</span>
          <span><strong>National Cheng Kung University</strong> · Project Manager (Office of International Affairs) — ran the international secretariat for the SATU Presidents' Forum, coordinating partnerships across 5+ countries.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
